                                "text": "статью ну́жно немно́го дотяну́ть",
                                "translation": "the article needs a touch-up",
                                "english": "the article needs a touch-up"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87888410-eb2a-3949-8deb-14a0b1254fd9",
                        "entry_id": "d3605e54-3878-3920-b281-da58065bce07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to delay, to protract, to drag one's feet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7dc4017b-b892-46a7-b30b-77bb25c945c8",
                                "sense_id": "87888410-eb2a-3949-8deb-14a0b1254fd9",
                                "text": "он дотяну́л (де́ло) до того́, что упусти́л все возмо́жности",
                                "translation": "he kept putting the matter off till all chances were lost",
                                "english": "he kept putting the matter off till all chances were lost"
                            }
